{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853060/extras/b97c3650c68e2b61b76b4b302668ec28.avif?t=1752567149\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chinese survival horror</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as a former local TV journalist, venturing alone into a coastal village long cut off from the outside world,searching for your missing daughter\u2014who was taken without explanation.The village is sealed off by violent forces.And beneath the surface, something far worse is quietly spreading: a strange parasitic lifeform.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore, investigate, fight</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scavenge supplies, solve environmental puzzles, and face an evolving biological threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re no fighter\u2014but you\u2019ll be forced to shoot. Resources are limited, tension is constant.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Oppressive atmosphere + slow, deliberate pacing.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A closed environment. Claustrophobic battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A psychological journey through fear, control, and irreversible change\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>inspired by the bleak realism of East Asian survival horror</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3853060?t=1752567149","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853060/fdfe743ff81ae89be04b6e450ce65776cef1c678/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752567149","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853060/3678e98403c32ee9256e1c818866b7ff91750806/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752567149","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.aka